{"id":"9618_s26_32:1(a)","paper":"9618_s26_32","component":3,"session":"s","year":2026,"variant":2,"q":"1(a)","qn":1,"marks":2,"command_word":"Write","stem":"Write the pseudocode statement to declare a non-composite data type, Animals, that holds\n        the following data:\n        Alpaca, Chicken, Donkey, Duck, Goat, Pony, Sheep\n        ...................................................................................................................................................\n        ...................................................................................................................................................\n        ...................................................................................................................................................\n        .............................................................................................................................................","stem_ctx":"A user-defined data type is required to store the types of animals in a children’s zoo.","qp_page":2,"ms_page":5,"ms_text":"One mark per mark point (Max 2)\n MP1  TYPE Animals =\n MP2  (Alpaca, Chicken, Donkey, Duck, Goat, Pony, Sheep)\n Example answer\n TYPE Animals = (Alpaca, Chicken, Donkey, Duck, Goat, Pony,\n Sheep)","has_figure":true,"equivalent_of":null,"extension":false,"flags":["figure"]}
